  <History Date="04-01-13" Author="Peter Budd" Comment="Created" />
  <History Date="11-02-14" Author="RGB Power on Updater" Comment="Updated RGB Power on values to match Locate." />
  <History Date="14-04-16" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Changed colour macro, macro speed and macro fade to effect group and moved wheel slot accordingly in respones to manufacturer request." />
  <History Date="20-04-16" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Increased macro delay in response to manufacturer bug report." />
  <History Date="15-08-17" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Increased wheel resolution.  Standardised macro speed wheel directions." />
  <History Date="15-08-17" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Exported Standard and Extended R20 modes." />
  <History Date="30-12-17" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Added product thumbnail" />
  <History Date="30-12-17" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Added Atlabase ID's." />
  <History Date="03-01-18" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Changed RGBW to masters in Standard mode and added missing cell links." />
